# Core dumps
# NOTE: deliberately NOT `core.*` — this package ships src/memsearch/core.py, and a
# bare `core.*` pattern silently excludes it from the built wheel while an editable
# install keeps working, so the breakage only surfaces at real install time.
core.[0-9]*
*.core
